%description:
Header compression (ROHC) applies to IP sessions only: a bearer definition stating rohc
is an error when the base station installs it for a UE of an Ethernet PDU session (here
an on-demand bearer, installed when the UE's first frame arrives).

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.upf.hasEthernetBridge = true
*.ue[*].sessionType = "Ethernet"
*.ue[*].hasIpv4 = false
*.ue[0].numApps = 1
*.ue[0].app[0].typename = "EthernetSourceApp"
*.ue[0].app[0].source.packetLength = 100B
*.ue[0].app[0].source.productionInterval = 20ms
*.ue[0].app[0].source.initialProductionOffset = 0.1s
*.ue[0].app[0].io.interface = "cellular"
*.ue[0].app[0].io.remoteAddress = "FF-FF-FF-FF-FF-FF"
*.bearerConfigurator.onDemandDrbs = [{coreNetwork: "5gc", isDefault: true, suppressSdapHeader: true, lcg: 3, rlcMode: "UM", rohc: true}]

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
ConnectionControlEnb: the definition of DRB 1 of NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[0] states "rohc", but the UE's session is of type "Ethernet" -- header compression (ROHC) applies to IP sessions only
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
